So much so that they were like, you do have great facts.
以至于他们都说，你的冷知识确实很棒。

483
00:21:28.770 --> 00:21:32.650
And it just cracked me up to hear you talking about your fun facts, and now you have your
听到你聊自己的冷知识，我简直笑死，现在你又有了

484
00:21:32.650 --> 00:21:33.390
fast facts.
快问快答冷知识。

485
00:21:33.390 --> 00:21:38.350
I'll tell you what, when I would go into DVD commentaries, I was often worried that I wouldn't
跟你说吧，以前我去录DVD评论音轨时，经常担心自己

