00:21:44.810 --> 00:21:51.030
I wanted to come in with like an interesting tidbit that we could throw in there if there
我想带一些有趣的边角趣闻来，如果在某个

489
00:21:51.030 --> 00:21:54.410
was ever a moment where we weren't covering something about the show.
时候我们没有聊到剧集内容，就可以把这些抛出去。

490
00:21:54.530 --> 00:21:55.590
This is why I love you.
这就是我爱你原因。

491
00:21:55.790 --> 00:21:57.030
