So when we started, they had Ellie perform all of her scenes and all of her talking heads
所以当我们开始的时候，他们让艾莉用两种不同的方式、作为两个不同的角色，演完了她所有的戏份和所有的采访镜头

502
00:22:38.410 --> 00:22:41.990
two different ways, as two different characters.
也就是两个不同的角色。

503
00:22:42.150 --> 00:22:43.090
I remember this.
我记得这个。

504
00:22:43.330 --> 00:22:47.970
She had to do them in like that earnest, quirky way that we know and love as Aaron.
她必须以我们所熟悉并喜爱的亚伦那种认真、古怪的方式来演。

505
00:22:47.970 --> 00:22:49.710
And that's the one we eventually go with.
而那也是我们最终采用的版本。

506
00:22:50.250 --> 00:22:56.450
But Gene said, believe it or not, there exists a bizarro Aaron where her lines are also delivered
但吉恩说，信不信由你，其实存在一个怪异版的亚伦，她的台词也是以一种

507
00:22:56.450 --> 00:22:58.090
in a no-nonsense way.
严肃认真的方式说出来的。

508
00:22:59.270 --> 00:23:03.950
And I asked him, how long did she have to do this before they decided?
我问他，在他们做决定之前，她这样拍了多久？

509
00:23:04.650 --> 00:23:12.590
And he said they definitely had like two totally different versions of her talking heads written.
他说他们绝对写了两个完全不同版本的采访镜头。

510
00:23:13.170 --> 00:23:18.870
And then in her scenes with Dwight and Andy hitting on her, she had to then perform those with
然后在她和德怀特以及对她献殷勤的安迪演对手戏时，她必须用

511
00:23:18.870 --> 00:23:20.330
different characteristics.
不同的性格特征来表演。

512
00:23:21.550 --> 00:23:26.090
I mean, Gene said he gives her so much credit because this was her first big role on a TV
我是说，吉恩说他对她佩服得五体投地，因为这是她电视剧生涯中的

513
00:23:26.090 --> 00:23:26.410
show.
第一个大角色。

514
00:23:26.410 --> 00:23:30.390
And she basically did two versions of Aaron in every scene for the entire week.
而且她基本上在整整一周里，每个场景都演了两个版本的亚伦。

515
00:23:30.610 --> 00:23:34.670
So until you shared about that sort of two versions of Aaron, I had forgotten about it.
所以直到你分享了关于那种两个版本亚伦的事，我才把这事给忘了。

516
00:23:34.790 --> 00:23:37.170
But now there's a deleted scene that makes sense to me.
但现在有一个被删减的片段我能理解了。

517
00:23:37.870 --> 00:23:38.950
Aaron just looks at camera.
亚伦只是看着镜头。

518
00:23:38.950 --> 00:23:43.510
You know, she's doing a talking head and she's just like, do I have to do one of these on
你知道的，她在做一个采访镜头，然后她就像是在说，难道我所有的休息时间

519
00:23:43.510 --> 00:23:44.250
all of my breaks?
都得做这个吗？

520
00:23:44.550 --> 00:23:45.010
Yes!
没错！

521
00:23:45.550 --> 00:23:46.010
Angela!
安吉拉！

522
00:23:46.710 --> 00:23:53.230
James Carey had the candy bag for this episode and it included Aaron's two talking heads, neither
詹姆斯·凯瑞这一集带了糖果袋，里面包含了亚伦的两个采访镜头，这两个

523
00:23:53.230 --> 00:23:54.650
of which end up in the episode.
最后都没有剪进正片里。

524
00:23:54.910 --> 00:23:56.550
Well, one of them is on the DVD.
嗯，其中一个在DVD里。

525
00:23:56.990 --> 00:23:57.430
Okay.
好的。

526
00:23:57.790 --> 00:24:03.590
This is the one that was in the candy bag as their first choice, which was, it's pretty
这个就是糖果袋里的首选，内容是，挺酷的，就像其他办公室一样吧，我想，有电话、电脑、复印机。

527
00:24:03.590 --> 00:24:09.590
cool, like any other office, I guess, phones, computers, copiers.
我所有休息时间都得做这个吗？

528
00:24:10.190 --> 00:24:12.250
Do I have to do this on all my breaks?
我所有休息时间都得做这个吗？

529
00:24:12.570 --> 00:24:12.770
Yeah!
没错！

530
00:24:13.130 --> 00:24:14.530
Is that the one that's in the middle of it?
那是中间那段吗？

531
00:24:14.690 --> 00:24:17.750
Yeah, and I was a little confused because I thought it felt sort of off.
对，我当时有点困惑，因为我觉得感觉有点不对劲。

532
00:24:18.070 --> 00:24:21.630
Then they had this must shoot alternate, which went like this.
然后他们拍了这个必须拍摄的备选镜头，内容是这样的。

533
