Most places you go, the chairs are really crappy and you're uncomfortable all day.
你去的大多数地方，椅子都很烂，你一整天都不舒服。

534
00:24:26.130 --> 00:24:27.590
My chair here is great.
我这里的椅子好极了。

535
00:24:27.590 --> 00:24:29.890
But I really hope this works out.
但我真的希望这能行。

536
00:24:30.870 --> 00:24:33.750
And that was like the one that quirky Aaron would say.
这就好像是古怪的亚伦会说的话。

537
00:24:34.210 --> 00:24:34.430
Yeah.
对。

538
00:24:34.810 --> 00:24:39.730
I guess that's our sign that the office got the new chairs because she's loving Pam's chair.
我想那是办公室换了新椅子的信号，因为她很喜欢帕姆的椅子。

539
00:24:39.970 --> 00:24:40.550
That's it.
就是这样。

540
00:24:40.730 --> 00:24:44.130
I think Pam finally got her new chair and now she's working down in Michael Scott Paper
我想帕姆终于换了新椅子，而现在她正在迈克尔·斯科特纸业公司

541
00:24:44.130 --> 00:24:44.510
Company.
工作。

