831
00:37:17.220 --> 00:37:17.720
Okay.
好吧。

832
00:37:18.440 --> 00:37:24.820
The Paper Pro is the first engineering breakthrough in staplers since, well, the stapler.
Paper Pro是自订书机诞生以来，在订书机领域的第一项工程突破。

833
00:37:25.520 --> 00:37:31.240
Push it with one finger's worth of effort, and a spring-loaded mechanism drives the staple
只需花费一根手指的力气去按压，弹簧加载机制就能产生

834
00:37:31.240 --> 00:37:35.840
with 30 pounds of force through up to 20 sheets of paper.
30磅的冲击力，轻松订透多达20页纸。

835
00:37:36.360 --> 00:37:36.960
Wow.
哇。

836
00:37:37.340 --> 00:37:38.720
We loved that stapler.
我们太爱那个订书机了。

837
00:37:38.940 --> 00:37:39.740
We loved it.
爱不释手。

838
00:37:40.020 --> 00:37:44.900
Of all the things I thought we would talk about today, I did not think we'd talk about a super
在今天所有我想过要聊的话题里，我没想到我们会聊到一个超级

