00:40:10.360 --> 00:40:12.780
Like, Kelly is using self-fulfilling prophecy.
就像，凯莉在运用自我实现的预言。

891
00:40:13.180 --> 00:40:22.360
My mom used to have this saying, and I think it's like paraphrasing scripture and proverbs, but speak of what is not as if it were so, and it shall become.
我妈妈以前有句口头禅，我觉得这有点像是改编自《圣经》和《箴言》，但“信所不见的，它就必成真”。

892
00:40:22.360 --> 00:40:23.300
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

893
00:40:24.040 --> 00:40:50.600
Mm-hmm.
嗯哼。

894
00:40:50.600 --> 00:40:53.860
Kelly is practicing self-fulfilling prophecy.
凯莉正在实践自我实现的预言。

895
00:40:54.200 --> 00:40:55.140
It's great.
太棒了。

896
00:40:55.160 --> 00:40:57.040
I use that all the time.
我经常用这个。

897
00:40:57.380 --> 00:40:58.500
We talk about that.
我们聊过这个。

898
00:40:58.640 --> 00:40:58.840
Yeah.
是啊。

899
00:40:59.040 --> 00:41:04.840
I mean, just in the formation of this podcast, we must have said what we wanted for two years.
我的意思是，光是为了筹备这个播客，我们肯定就把我们想要的东西念叨了两年。

900
00:41:05.020 --> 00:41:05.280
Yeah.
对啊。

901
00:41:05.280 --> 00:41:09.320
Before we developed this show and signed a contract.
在我们开发这个节目并签约之前。

902
00:41:09.680 --> 00:41:10.760
Speak the positive.
说出积极的话。

903
00:41:11.220 --> 00:41:12.020
Speak it.
说出来吧。

904
00:41:12.200 --> 00:41:18.860
I always say when you blow out your birthday candles, you should tell everyone your wish because the more people who know,
我总是说，当你吹灭生日蜡烛时，你应该把愿望告诉每个人，因为知道的人越多，

